sequenceDiagram
  participant C as control
  participant W2 as worker 2
  participant W3 as worker 3
  participant S as session 7 chunk
  C->>S: create session 7: refcnt 1
  W2->>S: session_get(7): 1 → 2
  W3->>S: handle_timeout(7): put with no get, 2 → 1 (the bug)
  W2->>S: session_put(7), correct: 1 → 0, free
  S-->>W2: chunk goes into worker 2's tcache
  W2->>S: malloc same size, fill a pktbuf (same chunk)
  C->>S: table_dump() reads s->peer: packet bytes
  S-->>C: SIGSEGV, far from the cause
